docs-prd.prompt:
Please write a product requirements document (PRD) that:

1. Explains the background, target users and the problem to solve;
2. Lists the functional requirements with priority and acceptance criteria;
3. Describes the end-to-end flow of the core scenarios;
4. States clearly what is out of scope for this release;
